     1	= ERC-721 Wrapper
     2	
     3	Extension of the ERC-721 token contract to support token wrapping.
     4	
     5	Users can deposit and withdraw "underlying tokens" and receive a matching number of "wrapped tokens".
     6	This is useful in conjunction with other modules.
     7	
     8	
     9	[[usage]]
    10	== Usage
    11	
    12	In order to make https://docs.rs/openzeppelin-stylus/0.3.0/openzeppelin_stylus/token/erc721/extensions/wrapper/index.html[`ERC721Wrapper`] methods “external” so that other contracts can call them, you need to implement them by yourself for your final contract as follows:
